  _notesByID:
  - noteID: 100
    text: "Situation Report - Preliminary Summary\n\nOutbreak confirmed. Water is
      compromised. Clear instructions: retrieve the generator key in the shed, activate
      generator and escape. Without that... no way out. \n\nTrust no one.\n\n\u2014
      Dr. Elias Kessler\nAdvanced Response Unit, M.E.D.C.O.R.E.\nDate: 08/14 \u2014
      03:27 AM"
  - noteID: 200
    text: "Restart Protocol:\n\nPort A \u2013 The typical hue of urine.\nPort B \u2013
      The shade used in cold therapy.\nPort C \u2013 The color of herbal medicine.\nPort
      D \u2013 The trail of a ruptured artery.\n\nIf unsure, think like a doctor.\n\n\u2014
      Dr. Elias Kessler\nAdvanced Response Unit, M.E.D.C.O.R.E.\nDate: 08/16 \u2014
      04:15 PM:27 AM"
